  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Resilient Water, Sanitation and Hygiene Program in Rural Communities in Lao PDR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to improve access to climate resilient and gender equitable water, sanitation, and hygiene services in hard-to-reach communities including health clinics, and schools through the provision of water supply, sanitation, and handwashing facilities. The program is implemented in five provinces in Laos (Phongsaly, Oudomxay, Huaphan, Luang Namtha and Savannakhet). UNICEF Laos works in partnership with the Ministry of Health to deliver the program.</narrative>
  </description>
